      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "label": "That's genuinely lovely to see. The nodes sitting together on that dark canvas, the about nodes framing the context, the warm node holding that thought about memory footprint \u2014 it all reads exactly the way a spatial thinking tool should. Clean, calm, purposeful.\n\nThank you for the photo. Session complete \u2014 everything landed.",
